        "original_id": "d9426117-f2e1-551e-aa9b-eb560af81475",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alvin Lee, Chad Gray\n- Organizations: Ten Years After, Hellyeah, Mudvayne\n- Products: Nineteen Ninety-Four, I Hear You Rockin'\n\nFacts:\n- Alvin Lee was born as Graham Anthony Barnes on 19 December 1944 and died on 6 March 2013.\n- Chad Gray was born on October 16, 1971.\n- Alvin Lee was an English singer and guitarist best known as the lead vocalist and lead guitarist of Ten Years After.\n- Chad Gray is the lead vocalist for Hellyeah and was the former lead vocalist for Mudvayne.\n- Nineteen Ninety-Four is a 1994 album by Alvin Lee.\n- Nineteen Ninety-Four was released in the United States as I Hear You Rockin'.",
